Offsite includes code and ideas from these projects.

Ready Player One
  https://github.com/apekshik/ready-player-one
  Copyright (c) 2026 Apekshik Panigrahi. Contributed to Offsite under the MIT License.
  The 3D kit (rendering, sky, materials, avatars, poses, collision), the "Bracket" design system,
  and dev sign-in. Friends aboard: presence and WebRTC signaling (convex/presence.ts,
  convex/signals.ts), the peer-to-peer mesh (apps/web/src/net/peers.ts) and proximity voice
  (apps/web/src/voice/voice.ts).

Beam
  https://github.com/SupraluminalIntelligence/beam
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Supraluminal Intelligence and Beam contributors.
  The harness adapters (Claude Code, Codex), normalized run events, and the runner's shape.
  Beam's runner vendors part of T3 Code (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 T3 Tools Inc.); any piece
  carried over keeps its license file alongside it.

AgentCraft
  https://github.com/blendi-remade/agentcraft
  MIT License. Ideas only: a lead that plans and workers in their own worktrees, and a scripted
  team for demos without API usage.

Audio
  The game's sounds (apps/web/public/audio) and the launch video's soundtrack and effects
  (assets/audio) were generated for Offsite on fal.ai with ElevenLabs Sound Effects v2 and
  ElevenLabs Eleven Music. Each file's model, prompt and terms are listed in assets/audio/CREDITS.md.
